    <note id="bVA">
      <content>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">printf </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">来自</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> stdio.h</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">。格式字符串中的转换说明符应与参数类型相匹配，顺序一一对应。</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">float </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">作为</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> printf </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">的可变参数会提升为</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> double</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">，因此这里</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> float </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">和</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> double </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">均用</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false"> %f</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">。</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">%.2f </span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">控制显示的小数位，不改变变量本身。课堂让学生把</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">2</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">改为</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">3</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">观察输出。</span></p>
